## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Blaming Gemini for Polina's failures** — Director pushed back: repeating error = our bug. CONFIRMED — the storyboard "not found" was our episodeId-never-from-thread bug, not the model. (Storyboard v02 IS APPROVED, verified.) Gemini weakness is real but smaller (drops `reason` arg on triggerAgent) than the episode-context hole.
- **My first furniture fix (elevator/bedroom examples)** — Director: still too concrete, "повысь абстракцию, никаких лифтов/спален/мебели в скиллах". Re-cleaned to fully role-based. Then he flagged I OVER-corrected (anti-invention banned script-driven props too) → softened.
- **Crude furniture regex on regenerated plans** — false-positive: matched the anti-invention rule's own forbidden-word list ("carpet, bed…"); had to view actual images to confirm clean.
- **Polina on Gemini executing nudges** — drops required tool args (`reason` on triggerAgent fails every time; hallucinated UUID `a0e1b2c3…`; printed `<tool_code>print()` instead of real calls). Model weakness, separate from the episodeId bug.

