## What Has NOT Been Tried Yet (NEXT STEPS, priority order)

1. **COMMIT the episodeId fix** — `app/api/concierge/chat/route.ts` is uncommitted. Suggested msg: `fix(concierge): adopt thread-bound episode as request episodeId — kills Polina's guess-the-episode failures`. Also the PLAN.md pointer edit (→3fd92fd) is uncommitted.
2. **AnimaticPlayer "on screen" behaviour (IN-PROGRESS DIAGNOSIS — Director's open question)** — In the animatic timeline, shot 1 button shows approved video "on screen" + visible; shot 2 shows 3 drafts + 1 approved but NO "on screen" + nothing displays. ROOT FOUND in `components/animatic/AnimaticPlayer.tsx` ~line 838-846 + 1206: the cell resolver picks **newest NON-INVALIDATED version** (`vidShotsByShotId.get(shotId)?.[0]`), NOT newest-APPROVED. So a newer DRAFT outranks an APPROVED video; "on screen" = `v.id === cell.asset_id`. Shot 2 likely has drafts newer than its approved video (drafts have no rendered media → blank, nothing "on screen"). **Was about to verify SH01/SH02 VID-shot versions in DB when Director interrupted to save.** FIX direction: resolver should prefer APPROVED over a newer draft (newest-APPROVED-wins, consistent with rest of app) — OR Director invalidates the stale drafts. Tell Director: the timeline shows newest, not approved; clean the stale SH02 drafts or I fix the resolver.
3. **`reason` auto-default on triggerAgent** (concierge tool) — Gemini-Polina keeps omitting it. Make it optional/defaulted.
4. **Skill-abstraction audit** (backlog memory `backlog_skill_abstraction_audit`) — eref-shot-composition has a hardcoded "Elevator minimum canon set" (E10 content in a generic skill) + 4 more files. Move concretes DOWN to Bible/Brief, don't delete. q16в = later.
5. **approve-route forward principal='director'** into execute-from-plan so UI approvals also bypass the shot-cap (I only fixed the manual fire).
6. **Critic canon-check** (EPREV/CREAD flag objects absent from location canon) + **surgical-revision** (re-author preserves corrections, doesn't regen from scratch — SH26 v2 correct→v3 reverted).
7. **q12 Polina provider decision** — revert concierge to OpenAI for execution, or keep Gemini read-only? (Now reframed: a big chunk of her "unreliability" was OUR episodeId bug.)

